data: {"id": "0a48191868c242da-thinking-parallel_evidence-772", "run_id": "0a48191868c242da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 生命周期 (Metrics + Describe)**\n   - Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 在 namespace `aiops-case-03` 中，UID `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`，调度在 `node2`。\n   - **Phase: Pending**，条件 `ContainersNotReady`，容器 `app` 状态 `Waiting`，原因 `ContainerCreating`。\n   - 重启计数 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 为 **0**；未发生过 Crash/Terminated。\n\n2. **关键 Events (Describe)**\n   - **`Warning FailedMount`** (x60 over 111m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailabl", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789051669455, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

