data: {"id": "0a48191868c242da-final", "run_id": "0a48191868c242da", "seq": 777, "ts_ms": 1789051689287, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory: 32Mi`, `cpu: 50m` | 排除资源限制导致容器启动失败的可能性，证明配置合理。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi`, `cpu: 5m` | 证明调度所需的请求量较小，排除了资源不足导致的调度阻塞。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接证据：明确指出了 Pod 处于挂载卷失败状态的原因（ConfigMap 缺失）。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` | 辅助证据：证实挂载动作长期处于等待状态且多次重试失败。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending` | 证实 Pod 当前状态停滞，未进入运行期。 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (reason=ContainerCreating) | 指标验证：与 K8s 事件中的 `ContainerCreating` 状态完全对应。 |\n| 7 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0` | 排除因容器崩溃反复重启的问题，证明问题发生于启动前阶段。 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- **证据 1-2 vs 证据 3-4**：资源请求与限制正常，排除了资源瓶颈，而 K8s 事件明确指向了外部依赖（ConfigMap）的缺失，将故障范围锁定在配置引用错误。\n- **证据 3 vs 证据 6**：Metric 确认了容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，而 Event 揭示了造成该状态停滞的具体技术原因，两者因果逻辑闭环。\n- **日志/Trace 不可用说明**：由于容器未能成功启动，物理上未产生应用日志与业务 Trace，因此 `Logging` 与 `Tracing` 维度的 `not_applicable` 状态符合故障现象，不影响当前根因判断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod YAML 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → Kubelet 尝试挂载名为 'input' 的卷失败并无限期重试 → Pod 状态持续为 Pending/ContainerCreating，等待挂载超时 → 应用容器无法启动，呈现 ContainerCreating 状态且无重启记录\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：**Pod 定义中错误引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，且该卷配置为必填，导致 Kubelet 挂载卷失败。**\n\n该根因由以下事实支撑（见证据表）：\n- **直接错误**：K8s Event 明确报出 `MountVolume.SetUp failed ... configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（证据 3）。\n- **状态一致性**：Pod 处于 `Pending` 且 `restart_count` 为 0（证据 5, 7），说明故障发生在容器进程启动之前，与挂载失败的现象完全吻合。\n- **环境合理性**：资源请求与限制配置正常（证据 1, 2），排除了其他常见的调度或 OOM 原因。\n\n日志与 Trace 缺失是因为容器未启动所致，并非诊断缺陷。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 33.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 33.7s (Evidence 25.3s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 67.636, "metrics": {"run_id": "0a48191868c242da", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 67.6417441368103, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 67641.7441368103, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 63736.430406570435, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8094.993114471436, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3592.640161514282}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22519.091367721558, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 33681.432247161865, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11411.023616790771, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

